            <ArticleTitle>[Pain and the care relationship].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>34-5</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>From one social and cultural condition to another, and depending on their personal history, people do not react in the same way to the same type of injury or disease. Each pain is unique. Making the patient a player in his/her treatment is an essential component of an effective care relationship.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
